    "name": "Plunk Campaigns API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Plunk REST API for the open-source email platform for SaaS. Plunk unifies transactional email (send), event tracking for automations (track), contact / subscriber management, and marketing campaigns behind a single Bearer-authenticated API. Public API routes under /v1 return a wrapped envelope ({\"success\": true, \"data\": ...}); most routes require a secret key (sk_), while /v1/track may also be called with a public key (pk_) for client-side use. The same API is served by the hosted platform and by self-hosted (AGPL-3.0) deployments.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Plunk Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
